%PERFINIT.help:
Names the application instance and initializes the ARM interface. 

Syntax: %PERFINIT(APPNAME='application-name'); 

APPNAME='application-name'; 
is the application name. The value is a SAS character variable or quoted literal. 

Restriction: The application name has a 127-character limit.

%PERFSTRT.help:
Syntax: %PERFSTRT(TXNNAME='transaction-name'); 

Use the %PERFSTRT macro to signal the start of a transaction. The %PERFSTRT macro 
contains default user metrics.
